            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>Mailkin can now be downloaded from mailkin.app.</li>
  <li>The one-time purchase is now called Mailkin Translator Lifetime. It unlocks unlimited translation.</li>
  <li>Mailkin checks for new versions and offers to install them. To do that, it opens at login in the background, without a window; you can turn this off in Settings › Updates.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
